#
#       The kernel network settings the default tier asks of the network
#       watcher when it starts, before the first lease: no redirects, no
#       router advertisements or SLAAC on the interface that was already
#       there (IPv6 has no copy from `default`), TIME-WAIT assassination
#       refused, SYN cookies. The watcher starts a moment after init, so the
#       last is waited for.
